   <a target=\"_blank\"\n                                   href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/data-science-course?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_course_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\"\n                                   class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm\">\n                                    Learn More\n                                <\/a>\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                \n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n    \n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Data Scientist Salary Deciding Factors<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The salary of a Data Scientist in India depends on several important factors that influence earning potential and career growth. These factors help companies decide the right salary package based on your <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-skills\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">data science skills<\/a>, expertise, and job requirements. Below are the key factors that affect a Data Scientist\u2019s salary:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Experience Level:<\/strong> Freshers usually earn lower salaries, while mid-level and senior professionals receive higher packages based on their expertise and years of experience.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Technical Skills:<\/strong> Strong knowledge of Python, SQL, machine learning, data visualization, and big data tools can significantly increase salary opportunities.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Educational Qualification:<\/strong> Candidates with degrees in data science, computer science, statistics, or related fields often receive better salary packages.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Company Type:<\/strong> Top MNCs, product-based companies, and leading tech firms generally offer higher salaries compared to startups or small organizations.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Job Location:<\/strong> Salaries are often higher in metropolitan cities such as Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Mumbai, and Pune due to higher demand and the cost of living.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Industry Demand:<\/strong> Sectors such as healthcare, finance, e-commerce, and technology typically offer competitive salaries due to high demand for data professionals.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Certifications and Projects:<\/strong> Relevant certifications and hands-on project experience can improve salary prospects by showing practical skills and domain expertise.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Also Read<\/strong>: <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-roadmap\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Data Scientist Roadmap: A Guide for Beginners<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Data Scientist Salary in India (Based on Experience)<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>We have classified Data Scientist salaries into three main levels based on experience: fresher, mid-level, and senior-level professionals. Each level offers different salary packages depending on skills, knowledge, and hands-on experience.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Data scientist salary in India for freshers (0\u20132 years)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The average starting salary for freshers in India typically ranges from <a href=\"https:\/\/www.glassdoor.co.in\/Salaries\/data-scientist-salary-SRCH_KO0,14.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b94 LPA to \u20b98 LPA<\/a>, depending on skills, qualifications, internships, and project experience. Candidates with strong knowledge of Python, SQL, machine learning, and data visualization tools often receive better salary packages. Freshers usually have 0\u20132 years of experience at this stage.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Freshers from top institutes or those with strong practical projects may secure higher offers. As you gain experience and improve your technical expertise, your salary usually increases quickly within the first few years of your <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-career\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">data science career<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Mid-Level Data Scientist Salary in India (2 to 5 years)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The average salary for mid-level Data Scientists in India generally ranges from <a href=\"https:\/\/www.glassdoor.co.in\/Salaries\/data-scientist-salary-SRCH_KO0,14.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b98 LPA to \u20b918 LPA<\/a>. Professionals with around 2 to 5 years of experience usually come under this level, depending on their skills, projects, and company role.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>At this stage, strong expertise in machine learning, data analysis, Python, SQL, and model building helps in securing better salary packages. Professionals working in top companies and metro cities often receive higher salaries along with bonuses and additional benefits.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Senior Data Scientist Salary in India (10 years)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The average salary for senior Data Scientists in India generally ranges from <a href=\"https:\/\/www.glassdoor.co.in\/Salaries\/data-scientist-salary-SRCH_KO0,14.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b920 LPA to \u20b930 LPA<\/a>. Professionals with around 5+ years of experience usually fall under this category, depending on their skills, expertise, and company type.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>At this level, they work on advanced machine learning models, predictive analytics, and complex business problems. They also handle large datasets and help improve business strategies through valuable insights.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>In many organizations, senior Data Scientists also lead teams and mentor junior professionals. When discussing data scientist salaries in India after 10 years, professionals moving into roles like Technical Lead, Data Science Lead, or Principal Data Scientist can earn around \u20b925 LPA to \u20b950 LPA or even higher, especially in top companies and product-based organizations.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The average data scientist salary in India, as per experience, can be summarized as follows:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Experience Level<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Years of Experience<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Average Salary in India<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Fresher \/ Junior Data Scientist<\/td><td>0\u20132 years<\/td><td>\u20b94 LPA \u2013 \u20b98 LPA<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Mid-Level Data Scientist<\/td><td>2\u20135 years<\/td><td>\u20b98 LPA \u2013 \u20b918 LPA<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Senior Data Scientist<\/td><td>5+ years<\/td><td>\u20b920 LPA \u2013 \u20b930+ LPA<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Technical Lead \/ Data Science Lead<\/td><td>10+ years<\/td><td>\u20b925 LPA \u2013 \u20b950+ LPA<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"790\" height=\"490\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/average-data-scientist-salary-india.webp\" alt=\"Average Data Scientist Salary in India by Experience\" class=\"wp-image-18359\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/average-data-scientist-salary-india.webp 790w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/average-data-scientist-salary-india-300x186.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/average-data-scientist-salary-india-768x476.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 790px) 100vw, 790px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Data Scientist Salary In India (Based on Location)<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The salary of a Data Scientist in India also varies based on the city and job location. Metro cities and major IT hubs usually offer higher salary packages because of better job opportunities, top companies, and higher demand for skilled professionals. Below is the table showing the average Data Scientist salary in different cities across India:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Location \/ City in India<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Average Data Scientist Salary<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Bangalore<\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/data-scientist-salary\/bengaluru-location\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b915.4 \u2013 \u20b917 LPA<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Mumbai<\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/data-scientist-salary\/mumbai-location\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b915.2 \u2013 \u20b916.8 LPA<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Chennai<\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/data-scientist-salary\/chennai-location\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b914.8 \u2013 \u20b916.4 LPA<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Pune<\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/data-scientist-salary\/pune-location\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b914.2 \u2013 \u20b915.7 LPA<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Kolkata<\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/data-scientist-salary\/kolkata-location\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b914.7 \u2013 \u20b916.3 LPA<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Hyderabad<\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/data-scientist-salary\/hyderabad-location\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b915.1 \u2013 \u20b916.7 LPA<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>New Delhi<\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/data-scientist-salary\/new-delhi-location\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b915.4 \u2013 \u20b917 LPA<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Noida&nbsp;<\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/data-scientist-salary\/noida-location\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b915 \u2013 \u20b916.6 LPA<\/a><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"989\" height=\"490\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/average-data-scientist-salary-india-city.webp\" alt=\"Average Data Scientist Salary by City in India\" class=\"wp-image-18360\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/average-data-scientist-salary-india-city.webp 989w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/average-data-scientist-salary-india-city-300x149.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/average-data-scientist-salary-india-city-768x381.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 989px) 100vw, 989px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Data Scientist Salary in India (In Top Companies)<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The salary of a Data Scientist in India also varies significantly based on the company. Top product-based companies, global tech firms, and leading e-commerce organizations generally offer much higher salary packages compared to service-based companies. Below is the table showing the average Data Scientist salary in the top companies in India:&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Company Name<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Average Data Scientist Salary<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Google<\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/salaries\/google-salaries\/data-scientist\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b927.7 \u2013 \u20b930.6 LPA<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Amazon<\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/salaries\/amazon-salaries\/data-scientist\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b924.4 \u2013 \u20b927.4 LPA<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Flipkart<\/td><td>