ive Internship + 100% Job Support<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FAQs About Data Scientist Salary<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"schema-faq wp-block-yoast-faq-block\"><div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1776236833547\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">1. What is the average salary of data scientist in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">The average salary of a data scientist in India ranges between \u20b910 LPA to \u20b915 LPA. It depends on experience, skills, location, and company, with higher salaries offered in top organizations and metro cities.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1776236842007\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">2. What is the starting salary for a fresher data scientist in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Freshers in data science typically earn between \u20b94 LPA to \u20b98 LPA in India. Candidates with strong skills, internships, and practical projects can secure better salary packages even at the entry level.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1776236852182\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">3. How much does a data scientist earn per month in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">A data scientist in India earns around \u20b940,000 to \u20b91,25,000 per month on average. This monthly salary varies based on experience, company, and expertise in tools like machine learning and analytics.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1776236863544\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">4. What is the salary of a data scientist with 2\u20135 years of experience in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Data scientists with 2\u20135 years of experience usually earn between \u20b98 LPA to \u20b918 LPA. Salaries increase based on advanced skills, project experience, and working in high-paying industries or companies.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1776236875019\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">5. What is the highest salary of a data scientist in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">The highest salary of a data scientist in India can exceed \u20b950 LPA or more in top product-based companies. Senior professionals and leads with strong expertise can earn very high compensation packages.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1776236886775\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">6. Which city offers the highest data scientist salary in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Cities like Bangalore, Mumbai, Hyderabad, and Delhi offer the highest salaries for data scientists. Bangalore is considered the top-paying city due to the presence of major tech companies and startups.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1776236898929\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">7. Do data scientists earn more than software engineers in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Yes, data scientists often earn salaries equal to or higher than software engineers, especially in advanced roles. Their expertise in machine learning and analytics makes them highly valuable in many industries.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1776236913870\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">8. What skills increase a data scientist\u2019s salary in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Skills like machine learning, deep learning, Python, SQL, big data technologies, and cloud computing significantly increase a data scientist\u2019s salary. Practical experience and strong project portfolios also improve earning potential.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1776236925122\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">9. How does experience affect data scientist salary in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Experience plays a major role in salary growth. As you gain more experience, your ability to handle complex projects improves, leading to higher salaries and better job opportunities in top companies.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1776236935930\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">10. What is the salary of Data Scientist in Amazon India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">The average salary of a Data Scientist at Amazon in India typically ranges from \u20b923.4 Lakhs to \u20b926.2 Lakhs per year, depending on experience (from 1 year to 8 years). The top 10% of Data Scientists at Amazon earn more than \u20b941.7 Lakhs per year, and the top 1% earn over \u20b950.0 Lakhs per year.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1776236951107\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">11. Is data science a high-paying career in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Yes, data science is one of the highest-paying careers in India due to increasing demand. Professionals with the right skills and experience can earn high salaries and achieve strong career growth.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1776236963468\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">12. How much do freelance data scientists earn in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Freelance data scientists in India can earn \u20b9500 to \u20b95,000 per hour or more depending on experience. Monthly income varies widely based on projects, clients, and expertise in specialized areas.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1776236975456\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">13. What is the future salary growth for data scientists in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">The future salary growth for data scientists in India is strong due to rising demand. As industries adopt data-driven strategies, professionals can expect continuous salary increases and better career opportunities.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1776236988218\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">14. Can a Data Scientist earn 1 crore per annum?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Yes, experienced data scientists and technical leads working in top companies or international roles can earn \u20b91 crore per annum. This usually requires advanced skills, leadership roles, and extensive experience.<\/p> <\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/data-analytics-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogBanner&amp;utm_campaign=seo&amp;utm_page=\/data-scientist-salary\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\" noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1546\" height=\"381\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/da-course-3.webp\" alt=\"Data Analytics Course Banner\" class=\"wp-image-12832\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/da-course-3.webp 1546w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/da-course-3-300x74.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/da-course-3-1024x252.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/da-course-3-768x189.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/da-course-3-1536x379.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1546px) 100vw, 1546px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p><strong>Conclusion<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Data science has emerged as one of the most rewarding and high-paying career options in India, offering excellent growth opportunities across industries. From freshers to experienced professionals, salaries increase significantly with skills, experience, and expertise in advanced technologies like machine learning and big data.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>As the demand for data-driven decision-making continues to rise, companies are actively looking for skilled data scient