 like machine learning and analytics.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236863544\",\"position\":4,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236863544\",\"name\":\"4. What is the salary of a data scientist with 2\u20135 years of experience in India?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Data scientists with 2\u20135 years of experience usually earn between \u20b98 LPA to \u20b918 LPA. Salaries increase based on advanced skills, project experience, and working in high-paying industries or companies.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236875019\",\"position\":5,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236875019\",\"name\":\"5. What is the highest salary of a data scientist in India?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The highest salary of a data scientist in India can exceed \u20b950 LPA or more in top product-based companies. Senior professionals and leads with strong expertise can earn very high compensation packages.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236886775\",\"position\":6,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236886775\",\"name\":\"6. Which city offers the highest data scientist salary in India?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Cities like Bangalore, Mumbai, Hyderabad, and Delhi offer the highest salaries for data scientists. Bangalore is considered the top-paying city due to the presence of major tech companies and startups.\",\"