is the average salary of data scientist in India?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The average salary of a data scientist in India ranges between \u20b910 LPA to \u20b915 LPA. It depends on experience, skills, location, and company, with higher salaries offered in top organizations and metro cities.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236842007","position":2,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236842007","name":"2. What is the starting salary for a fresher data scientist in India?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Freshers in data science typically earn between \u20b94 LPA to \u20b98 LPA in India. Candidates with strong skills, internships, and practical projects can secure better salary packages even at the entry level.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236852182","position":3,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236852182","name":"3. How much does a data scientist earn per month in India?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A data scientist in India earns around \u20b940,000 to \u20b91,25,000 per month on average. This monthly salary varies based on experience, company, and expertise in tools like machine learning and analytics.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236863544","position":4,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236863544","name":"4. What is the salary of a data scientist with 2\u20135 years of experience in India?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Data scientists with 2\u20135 years of experience usually earn between \u20b98 LPA to \u20b918 LPA. Salaries increase based on advanced skills, project experience, and working in high-paying industries or companies.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236875019","position":5,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236875019","name":"5. What is the highest salary of a data scientist in India?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The highest salary of a data scientist in India can exceed \u20b950 LPA or more in top product-based companies. Senior professionals and leads with strong expertise can earn very high compensation packages.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236886775","position":6,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236886775","name":"6. Which city offers the highest data scientist salary in India?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Cities like Bangalore, Mumbai, Hyderabad, and Delhi offer the highest salaries for data scientists. Bangalore is considered the top-paying city due to the presence of major tech companies and startups.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236898929","position":7,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236898929","name":"7. Do data scientists earn more than software engineers in India?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, data scientists often earn salaries equal to or higher than software engineers, especially in advanced roles. Their expertise in machine learning and analytics makes them highly valuable in many industries.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236913870","position":8,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236913870","name":"8. What skills increase a data scientist\u2019s salary in India?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Skills like machine learning, deep learning, Python, SQL, big data technologies, and cloud computing significantly increase a data scientist\u2019s salary. Practical experience and strong project portfolios also improve earning potential.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236925122","position":9,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236925122","name":"9. How does experience affect data scientist salary in India?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Experience plays a major role in salary growth. As you gain more experience, your ability to handle complex projects improves, leading to higher salaries and better job opportunities in top companies.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236935930","position":10,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-scientist-salary\/#faq-question-1776236935930","name":"10. What is the salary of Data Scientist in Amazon India?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The average salary of a Data Scientist at Amazon in India typically ranges from \u20b923.4 Lakhs to \u20b926.2 Lakhs per year, depending on experience (from 1 year to 8 years). The top 10% of Data Scientists at Amazon earn more than \u20b941.7 Lakhs per year, and the top 1% earn over \u20b950.0 Lakhs per year.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"